{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PLiWaQWCs78A8ym_g4KxhQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:52.230509+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PLiWaQWCs78A8ym_g4KxhQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>一流的师资条件</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中科院院士：1人</span></span></p><p><span>长江特聘教授：4人</span></p><p><span>国家杰出青年基金获得者：11人</span></p><p><span>国家级优秀青年人才计划获得者：15人</span></p><p><span>百千万人才工程领军人才：1人</span></p><p><span>科技创新领军人才：3人</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>现代光学研究所作为北京大学物理学院重要组成部分，底蕴深厚、气氛和睦，是“人工微结构和介观物理全国重点实验室”和“纳光电子前沿科学中心”的重要组成部分，经费充足、条件完善。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>为学生开拓国际视野，现代光学研究所与国际顶级研究机构和大学保持着频繁的学术交流，鼓励学生参加各种本领域国际学术会议。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>前沿的研究方向</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>介观光学与微纳光子学</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span></span><span>研究光子与电子、原子等物质在微纳尺度强局域下的耦合与调控机理，实现新型高性能介观光子器件与集成光子芯片，应用于通信、大数据互连、人工智能、精密测量、多维度感知等重要领域。</span><span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"介观.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD67tJtHTJzbzg0ebBX3iavKDqJH7FcnSL2dtNSg6G0hKJtgmuKdg9Liaog/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>量子光学与量子芯片</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>研究量子纠缠的检测及其应用，</span></span><span><span>研究</span></span><span><span>微纳结构中量子光学和量子信息过程，</span></span><span><span>制备</span></span><span><span>大规模光量子芯片</span></span><span><span>与</span></span><span><span>三维</span></span><span><span>光子芯片，研究集成</span></span><span><span>量子光源和单光子探测器</span></span><span><span>等量子器件</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>研究可扩展的光</span></span><span><span>量子计算</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>量子网络</span></span><span><span>和量子</span></span><span><span>模拟，</span></span><span><span>发展混合型光量子信息处理新技术，研究</span></span><span><span>多光子非线性过程实现超快高分辨成像等。</span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"量子.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD6Xlu7aKBFCdIvFV5yd9AUSSBibSHmNczJAx0VibuzZRccJTwSVdicbqeibA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>超快科学与非线性光学</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span></span><span>发展新型超快激光技术，揭示超快强场极端物理条件下光与物质相互作用的新现象与新规律，重点研究极端超快非线性光学、强场量子光学效应、超高时空分辨光谱和光电子成像、超快光场调控机制与应用等。</span><span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"超快.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD6G1vroUe1h7aTl0MKqmibPo7TKibL1NXK9HXFY9RFmUtFp8XPfNBnUiaWg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>阿秒物理、超快原子与量子调控</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span></span><span>原子分子在超短强激光脉冲作用下的超快动力学及量子操控研究，原子与分子在外场中行为的理论模拟和实验研究，发展超冷原子实验技术，开展量子模拟；发展量子显微镜，实现光镊阵列里德堡原子阵列，实现量子计算及量子精密测量研究。</span><span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"阿秒.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD6ibicic9L1niciaLzdicTZxoicdXiaO4pI2zufibGWDr61vBhBuTSB1knXqaIqCA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>光电功能分子与材料和器件</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span></span><span><span>开展光电功能</span></span><span><span>材料和器件</span></span><span><span>的研究，探索</span></span><span><span>新型介观光电功能材料</span></span><span><span>和器件</span></span><span><span>体系，</span></span><span><span>厘清材料</span></span><span><span>结构与性能的构效关系，发展开发高</span></span><span><span>性能</span></span><span><span>光伏技术、宽色域高刷新率光电显示技术以及高灵敏度全波段光电探测技术，服务国家“</span></span><span><span>双碳</span></span><span><span>”战略</span></span><span><span>和光电产业</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"光电1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD6yyRXcJQnSicfnqK5J9kAFdunQUgpuHyeMAJHalhAwCGLJ5OlUCfuMkw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>先进的设备平台</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"主席视察平台.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI47Fiaf9xWCnibRYqkDvDgibQJEia4HPibpfrpLEibEOIG456ArYZSWwQ8RlWA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"peem.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4zJfiazv5TmkbeQ1JY1pTu3MH3FSkQ0gYZ40QPbK10MWTpslZWGJcUZg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>在超快时间和超小空间尺度上测量和调控电子行为可以揭示量子世界的基本规律，进而为人类开发新材料、设计新结构、以及施加外场等手段操纵光电子行为行为提供支持，指导设计和和优化光电子信息器件功能。现代光学研究所围绕超快时间和超小空间分辨开展研究，研制了多套国际先进的实验装置，并建成飞秒-纳米时空分辨实验平台，同时实现超快时间和超小空间分辨测量。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095752.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI46v4D6IgqBXfg3uDWRIP2fibeegtG3sbs0myM7PAnlE6UWQLpY4ImqqQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095758.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4j1RRjNx6TUuicrjMU0voLS7h0dD58iciaSR9Kia7I0Ol7b1G1xZoq2CyYg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095720.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4A9HhxSTvxkCcHDamgVH2jGFp3v8qaAl5OtiadeibDcdfHOHZ3IDWgib3Q/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095731.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4yRVk3ibdbBicoXCkIu1xbMP5mtFOQuXV2bazZ9VF3Qs9yhNLDopp6t0A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>依托纳光电子前沿科学中心的纳光电子加工与测试平台，配备了大量的高端加工测试设备。作为校级公共平台，将为高校和企业提供科研与产业化开发支撑。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>丰富的科研生活</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"0E2A2703.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4B1HkPiaGOlkK1OXnN21qHE8DSN1s3oJRQVvbvDZtY3qVO0LOJIW6sZg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>光学所举办丰富的学术活动，并受到SPIE、OSA北京大学分会的支持。除诸多国内国外交流的机会外，光学所还经常邀请国内外的学术名家、科技新锐前来与师生讨论。特别设立“所长奖学金”，用以奖励科研工作突出的同学们，激励大家不断努力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"2024北京大学开学第一跑.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4oOfearWzZpibnb7MK5yglz9yCB8LYVib6o7K9LibglsDVibMgGiaqa4FNYA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>在学术活动之外，北大深厚的人文气息支撑起了学生丰富的文化活动。“大师身旁宜聆教，未名湖畔好读书”，在未名波光和博雅塔影里，浮躁的心总能平静下来。但这里绝不仅仅只有平静，二百多个学生社团、“北大剧星”、“十佳歌手”等品牌项目，一定会让你的生活更加精彩。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>优秀毕业生感言</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></sect