ion><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"戴天祥.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfaLGZUpAkaibiawtPFUiafAjD6GHrEm8BKZ6G7SASkmLlO6zzIuiaZyuKgcWQc0aiaicL9R12KD0iaLmynEg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知</span></strong></span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起至2025年5月26日12:00。</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名要求</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请资格：</span></span></p><p><span>a. 全国高校本科2026届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>b. 拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>c. 本科学习成绩和综合素质优异，英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>申请材料：</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>a</span></span></strong><span><span>. 夏令营申请表</span><span><span>1份(网上报名后打印生成，本人亲笔签字，并盖所在院系公章或教务章)；</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>b</span></span></strong><span><span>. 个人陈述1份（报名系统可生成模板，本人亲笔签字）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>c</span></span></strong><span><span>. 包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单原件1份（成绩单上须有学校（或院系）教务的正式公章或含验证信息，不能提供黑白或彩色复印件）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>d</span></span></strong><span><span>. 成绩证明1份（模板见附件，按要求签字并盖所在院系公章或教务章；如所在学校提供固定格式的成绩证明，可替代本模板）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>e</span></span></strong><span><span>. </span><span><span>英语水平证明材料复印件（四、六级英语成绩单，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>f</span></span></strong><span><span>. 其它证明材料（体现个人学术水平、有代表性的学术论文首页复印件，各类获奖证书复印件或相关证明等）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>g</span></span></strong><span><span>. 声明（模板见附件）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>h</span></span></strong><span><span>. 专家推荐信2封，专家须为所报学科专业领域内的副教授（含）以上或具有相当专业技术职称。在申请第二阶段，由专家直接提供。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>网报系统中每次修改信息，将会生成新的申请表校验码，请确保最终提交的纸质版申请表与网报系统校验码一致。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>申请材料除f项外均为必须提交内容，f项可根据个人情况选择提交。(北京大学物理学院本科生提供a-g项, 其中d项使用院教务办所发排名证明即可，且a项材料无需盖章)。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>如成功入营，须在夏令营报到时提交除h项以外的全部纸质材料原件，以备核验。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）第一阶段：北大系统填报（即日起至2025年5月26日12:00）</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>网上申报地址：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>https://admission.pku.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span> </span></span></span><span>注册登录后选择夏令营模块进行</span><span><span>填报（2025年5月26日12：00关闭网报系统）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子版报名材料提交：</span></span></p><p><span><span>a. 电子版报名材料须上传网报系统，同时发送到gwl-gx@pku.edu.cn：</span><span><span>除推荐信外</span></span><span>，其他所有材料按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文件（不超过10M，邮件命名为: 申请专业+姓名+本科学校名称）。为不影响阅读，请确保电子版材料每页清晰、完整、方正，不要随意拍照生成）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>拟报名光学所电子信息专业硕士项目——光子技术与应用光学的请在网报系统中“重点交叉学科”处填写电子信息，并在申请表的首页顶端空白处手写光子技术与应用光学，详细介绍见学院网站附件-物理学院重点交叉学科简介。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）第二阶段：物理学院系统填报，提交推荐信（拟定2025年5月20日至30日）</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>填报方式待系统开放时另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>推荐人邮箱信息务必准确；建议填报后及时提醒推荐人查收系统邮件，上传推荐信。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>材料审核及报名选拔</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>审核和选拔工作由物理学院夏令营活动工作小组负责。夏令营参营名单将于6月16日左右在北京大学物理学院网站上公布，不再另行通知，请大家关注。</span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>特别注意</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>有意参加本次夏令营的同学，请按照上述要求完成全部报名流程。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>申请者应保证提交的所有报名材料真实、有效、完整。如因提交不实信息或伪造材料造成不良后果，由申请者本人承担。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>报名邮箱</span></span></p><p><span><span>光学、原子与分子物理、电子信息（光子技术与应用光学）：</span><span><span>gwl-gx@pku.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>更多详细信息及附件，请查看物理学院夏令营报名通知网页：</span></p><p><span>https://www.phy.pku.edu.cn/info/1018/10989.htm</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>咨询邮箱：wlyjszs@pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：010-62751734</span></p><p><span>后续内容请留意北京大学物理学院主页</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KqL0CU7gadCictJz7V6XshoQzX8bCVYRKIVS9TbJz4owUmzJ5MMoaVXcXw7tJIrCM9JcRHiaoVtODR0t1NMPSQvg/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/p8LvicQQvBfZibno7YVptPyUJ8EJm5FCI4cVApjolBs8muugkcsA6kybosqhzSTtC8w8SKc2896acTzDjOHNvFdA/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>研究所更多详情</span></span></p><p><span><span>请关注微信公众号</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><span>编辑：李洪云</span></span></section></section><section><section><p><span>审核：吕国伟</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"59ea5e36da55b4c4b09f6d571f1f617a1be732a87ec0bdaffee85541c570afd3","textLength":2783,"sourceSha256":"f8558f3d99558aa678db141de63dd0596301ed9296744225d8d3ccfcf0c0edf8","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a5b89800a3e4a2f4404a","title":"2025年北京大学物理学院现代光学研究所2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:52.230509+00:00"}
